  "description": "Red de gasolineras líderes en el sector. Reposta de forma rápida y ahorra en combustible. Servicio 24 horas los 365 días del año.",
  "longDescription": "PETROPRIX is a leading network of gas stations offering high-quality fuel at the best prices. With over 120 locations across Spain, PETROPRIX ensures quick refueling and significant savings on fuel costs. Their services are available 24 hours a day, 365 days a year, providing convenience and accessibility to customers whenever they need it. PETROPRIX offers a wide range of fuels, including Diesel, Gasóleo A Aditivado con HQ300, Gasolina Sin plomo 95, and Gasolina Aditivado con HQ400, all known for their top-quality performance. Their commitment to delivering top-notch products is backed by over 2 million monthly customers and more than 15 million refuels in the past year. Customers rave about PETROPRIX, with over 300,000 reviews averaging 5 stars. They admire the affordable prices, the growing number of locations, and the convenience of their mobile app, allowing users to register their license plates and receive invoices seamlessly. Experience top-quality fuel and significant savings by visiting your nearest PETROPRIX gas station and become one of their satisfied customers.",
